# A PATTERN WITH NO SLASH IN FRONT MATCHES AT EVERY DEPTH.
#
# `queue/` was meant for the agent's runtime queue, which a local test run
# leaves beside the binaries. It also matched
# src/Vincere.AutoExport.Agent/Queue/, the SOURCE folder, so every file added
# there after this line was written was skipped by `git add -A` in silence.
# QueueCaptureReader.cs was committed only because CI failed to compile
# without it; the three files already tracked in that folder predate the rule.
# Anchored now, so it means the folder it was written for.
/queue/
/logs/
**/bin/queue/
**/bin/logs/
secret.bin
config.json
NinjaTraderReferences/
